WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
A hand turns a brass handle. The door opens into a marble hall.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.000
White stucco ceilings, a glass lantern, tall doors of carved wood.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
A staircase rises beneath a skylight. A hand follows the rail.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.500
The music room: a black grand piano, a painted ceiling, a faded tapestry.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Afternoon light through tall windows; a bedroom in grey and blue.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.500
A sash window opens onto terracotta roofs and the Tagus.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.500
The river, the 25 de Abril bridge and the Cristo Rei across the water.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.000
A last look along the corridor; the door closes.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.366
Silence. The palace returns to itself.
